# Cloudflare Pages headers for lookout.dosanjhlabs.com.
#
# The /* block carries the AI-usage signals (added with the ai-policy layer).
# Comments live out here, not between the header lines — Cloudflare's _headers
# parser documents comments only outside rule blocks. The four AI headers:
#   X-Robots-Tag: noai, noimageai  → publisher AI-training opt-out. It carries
#     NO noindex/nofollow — search indexing is REQUIRED and stays fully on.
#   Content-Usage: train-ai=n, search=y  → IETF AIPREF (draft-ietf-aipref-vocab)
#     structured-field per RFC 9651: reserve training, permit search/answer use.
#   TDM-Reservation: 1 + TDM-Policy: ...  → W3C TDM Reservation Protocol signal
#     (full rule set in /.well-known/tdmrep.json). Human policy: /ai-policy/.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noai, noimageai
  Content-Usage: train-ai=n, search=y
  TDM-Reservation: 1
  TDM-Policy: https://lookout.dosanjhlabs.com/ai-policy/
